	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"月刊誌ガンダムエース、少年エース掲載の「機動戦士ガンダムSEED ASTRAY、AstrayR」に登場する準主役機「ガンダムアストレイ(ブルーフレーム)」のHG仕様のプラモデル。各関節部は驚きの可動範囲を実現しています。ブルー用のバズーカ武器「M68キャットゥス500?無反動砲」が付属し、肩に担ぎ射撃ポーズも再現可能です。その他にビームサーベル×2、ビームライフル、シールドが付属します。"
		],
		"en": [
			"This is an HG plastic model of the semi-protagonist machine \"Gundam Astray (Blue Frame)\" that appears in \"Mobile Suit GundamSEED ASTRAY, AstrayR\" published in the magazines Gundam Ace and Small Ace. Each joint has an amazing range of motion. A bazooka weapon for Blue, \"M68 Cattus 500 Recoilless Rifle\" is included, and you can also recreate the shooting pose by carrying it on your shoulder. Also included are beam saber x 2, beam rifle, and Seal."
		]
	},
